# r1114 Power Grid rerun 2 pwg17r2 on jar jar_archive/pwg_gate/backportedPowerGrid-0.6.2-ce-19.2-17.jar (sha1 cbc2ddee37ca,
# the same jar as pwg17 and pwg17r). Reruns the pwg17r BATCH-FAULT rows (verdicts: perf/runs/r1114/verdicts/pwg17r.md)
# plus the chain setup they depend on (-76, SETUP15, -78, -79). Fixes against pwg17r:
#   SQ-PWG-90  pwg_p10_probe.js recipe line prints blank=[..] (Ingredient.EMPTY pattern cells: stairs 1,2,5, design table 4)
#              apart from unresolved=[..] (every stack a minecraft:barrier: Forge's "Empty Tag" filler; #forge:cardboard
#              is empty in the pack, D13, so deploying/ceiling_tile keeps unresolved=[1])
#   SQ-PWG-80  redstone and blaze powder go in before the water: with the water first the pack's creativedelight
#              water_salt mixing (heated, 1000 mB -> 2 salt, fluid only) ran before the items arrived
#   SQ-PWG-82  the part depots start empty and get their parts only after the circuit is fed and locked: in pwg17r the
#              arm moved the whole wire_connector x8 stack onto the belt before the circuit reached the arm (no
#              incomplete circuit centred, so the belt took it as a plain item), and the stack then filled the end depot
# Not repeated: SQ-PWG-91 (FAIL, port bug: ceiling_tile_* loot tables), -94, -95, -73, -81 and the rest (PASS in pwg17r).
# FRESH WORLD (level pwg17r2): the pwg17r world has the P9c chain built and used (salt in the acid basin, wire connectors
# on the belt end depot) and the SQ-PWG-SHOW17 showcase on top (X 1100 to 1123, Z 2010 to 2084).
# Group A superflat, level pwg17r2, spawn-animals=true, ground Y -61 (grass), blocks at Y -60. The world is peaceful.
# Areas: P10 X 1095 to 1135, Z 1995 to 2085 (SQ-PWG-90 forceload, no blocks placed); P9c X 1135 to 1200, Z 1855 to 1915
# (SQ-PWG-76 forceload; mixer cogs X+1 of each mixer at Y -58, motors on them at Y -57; arm cogs X+1 of each arm at
# Y -60, motors on them at Y -59)
# Prep: as pwg17r (scratch_run_2026-11-14.md, the 02:23 pwg17r line: tpf_srv.sh with COPYDEV=1 and PGJAR=the -17 jar),
# level pwg17r2. Probes: copy the CURRENT tools/scratch_query/pwg_*.js as zz_*.js (thirteen); check
#   grep -c "blank=" OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_pwg_p10_probe.js   (non-zero: the pwg17r2 p10)
#   Loading Protection: qrun.py toml OUT/srv/config/loadingprotection-common.toml '"Loading Protection Configuration"' protectionDuration 1
# Run: qrun.py run OUT tools/scratch_query/batches/r1113/pwg17r2.qb perf/runs/<run>/pwg17r2
# Probe goggle reads log a RuntimeDistCleaner ERROR (client class): no blanket ERROR reject.
# waitlog matches anywhere since the row start; real waits are sleeps (20 ticks = 1 s) plus pace (s after each command).
pace 1

